<title>FINLAND: Stockmann Feb sales rise 13.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Stockmann Feb sales rise 13.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish retailer Oy Stockmann Ab said in a statement on Wednesday its sales in February increased to 589.8 million markka from 519.9 million in February last year.  </p>
<p>Stockmann's sales in January-February rose 16.4 percent year-on-year to 1.28 billion markka, it said. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
